window.products.push({"id":215035,"name":"All-Clad Textiles Kitchen Towel, Solid-2 Pack, Pewter, 2 Count","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.67,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EiRs8rfIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A dutiful assistant throughout the home, All-Clad Solid Kitchen Towels (2-pack) are designed for maximum absorbency and durability, making them the ideal counterpart for kitchen tasks both big and small. A unique yard-dyed, “wave” terry loop and 100% soft, pre-washed Turkish Combed Cotton construction allows for extra reach into corners and crevices of cookware, dishes, and glasses when drying. The All-Clad Solid Kitchen Towel is 25% larger than the average kitchen towel, measuring 17 in. by 30 (43 cm by 76 cm), and it also works great as a drying mat for larger kitchen items. With a wide range of color options, you can coordinate your All-Clad Solid Kitchen Towel with the rest of the All-Clad Kitchen Textile line of pot holders, oven mitts, aprons, and more. Machine washable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EiRs8rfIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"All-Clad","source_asin":"B09RRG13NJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-215035","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RRG13NJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RRG13NJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":215036,"name":"Winproper 5-Pack Shower Caddy, Bathroom Shower Organizer with 16 Hooks, Adhesive Shower Shelves with 2 Soap Holder, No Drilling Stainless Steel Bathro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XT5UWwWHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⚡【5 Hanging Shower Organizers Set】Winproper bathroom shower shelves set include 3 shower caddies, 2 soap holders, 5 adhesives and 1 user manual. These large storage capacity bathroom organizer shower can store all of your bath supplies. ✅【Durable Rustproof Stainless Steel】The shower caddy bathroom storage made of high-quality SUS 304 stainless steel, waterproof, rust-proof, scratch-resistant. This material improves the corrosion resistance and scratch, which will still look new after long-term use. Hollowed bottom, drips fast and is easy to dry, keeps your stuff tidy and clean. ⚡【Large Capacity & Up to 30 LBS】 3 pack large capacity bathroom shower caddy with 2 soap dish and totally 16 hooks, each caddy shelf affords up to 30 LBS, enough to hold your bottles; this 2 soap holder solves your problem about dirty and slippery soaps, 16 hooks organize razor, washcloth, shower loofah, towels, hair rope etc. ✅【No Drilling & Easy Installation】Our shower holder organizer for inside shower simply stick adhesives, no drilling, taking all 5 mins without any tools needed, no damage to the walls. It is recommended to be pasted on a smooth, flat, and dry surface. ⚡【Multiple Usage】The adhesive shower caddy provide enough space to storage your daily products what you need in the bathroom, toilets, kitchen, dorm, living room and bedroom. If you use in kitchen, they will fit your Condiment bottles, Cooking spoons. Also, the shower racks for inside shower makes for an ideal gift to family, friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XT5UWwWHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winproper","source_asin":"B0BDRKN5GF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-215036","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDRKN5GF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDRKN5GF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
