window.products.push({"id":215207,"name":"Larger Gaiwan 8oz Chinese Kung Fu Sancai Tureen Tray Cup Tea Set Blue White flower (beauty A)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71reIv7hNcL._AC_SL1470_.jpg","description":"Specifications : cup size: 11.3cm (diameter)*6.2cm (height); Saucer diameter: 12.5cm; iteam Use capacity: 240ml; iteam Full capacity: 280ml. iteam hight: 10.6cm iteam weight: 390g Suitable for the crowd :all Package includes: 1* Lid+1* Cup+1* Saucer The Gaiwan is a traditional Chinese tea set with a lid on top, a tray on the bottom, and a bowl in the middle.Also known as \"Sancai bowl\", \"Sancai Cup\",The tea cover represents the sky, the saucer represents the earth, and the tea bowl represents human beings, implying that the heaven, the earth, and the earth are in harmony.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71reIv7hNcL._AC_SL1470_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"honeylive","source_asin":"B07QJ5BN4G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-215207","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QJ5BN4G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QJ5BN4G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
