window.products.push({"id":215336,"name":"Vegetable Juicer for Celery Wheatgrass Spinach Ginger, Fruit Juicer Machines Slow Masticating Juicer Cold Press Juice Extractor Pulp Separated, Quiet ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":152.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nQeZHFCqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"👍【Choose The Right Juicer】Why this fruit and veggies juicer? The auger juicer runs at a low speed of 80RPM, which helps preserve all important enzymes and nutrients. One-speed control design, easy to handle soft & hard fruits and vegetables, especially for leafy greens. Centrifugal juicers utilize a fast-spinning blade that generates heat, which destroys enzymes and oxidizes nutrients. Conversely, the juice extracted by the slow juicer has a rich taste and maintains its original taste. 👍【Start A Healthier Life】Updated in 2022, this juice extractor comes with advanced 7-segment auger masticating system and better filter, extracting maximum juice from vegetables and fruits in 7 steps- cut, break, squeeze, mill, seperate, grind and extract. Every drop is pure and delicious. Forget bottled juices that are super high in sugar and additives, Get healthy, enzyme rich, fresh juice, boost your immunity, keep away from diseases. Bring health and wellness home with this juicer. 👍【Safe Material, Worry-free Use】All detachable parts are made of high-quality raw material, BPA Free, safe to use in a long term.The electric juicer extractor has reverse function to avoid stuck. Using baking paint process, the surface of the juicer machine is smooth and bright, easier to clean and looks more textured than the plastic shell, glowing like new after decades of use. 200W motor, incredibly powerful for juicing apple, celery, orange, parsley, spinach, kale, wheatgrass, beet, carrot. 👍【Keep Fresh for 72Hours】One-click assembly, no tools required, each step has been optimized to ensure the easiest assembly and disassembly of your juicer extractor. Quiet motor, sturdy horizontal design, you won’t have the vibrations, shaking and noise issue that Centrifugal juicers often come with. Removable components are dishwasher-safe, easy to clean with water. You don't have to take the time to wipe off all the residue like other juicers. 👍【LUFVEBUT Brand, Leading Warranty & Service】Unique design concept, strong R&D production capacity, we have always focused on the needs of families for high quality juicers and continue to innovate. All juicers are ETL and GS certificated, we offer 15-year warranty for the motor, and 3-year warranty for remaining parts. You will enjoy lifetime technical support and 24/7 customer service, any questions, please contact us asap, we will respond and offer solutions immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nQeZHFCqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUFVEBUT","source_asin":"B0BSF5CXSR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-215336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSF5CXSR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSF5CXSR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
