window.products.push({"id":215346,"name":"HPD Half Price Drapes Heavy Linen Curtain 50 X 108, (1 Panel) FHLCH-VET200213-108, British Navy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":72.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M3vUSEgIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When you want glamor, style, and modern yet classic curtains, these natural linen blend panels are an excellent choice. This concise collection features polyester blended with linen for a resulting luxurious, supple, curtain. They’re lovely for rooms that get tons of sun exposure, as they’ll let that natural light stream in, but they’re great for rooms that don’t get much sun because the sun you do get will be maximized. These curtains have our most versatile header, a rod pocket with back tabs and hook belt and a weighted hem to hang nicely and keep them in place. There is a 3.5\" pole pocket in the header and back tab loops that will accommodate up to a 1.5\" diameter curtain rod with no additional hardware. Additionally, these panels can be attached to curtain rings from clips or by running an S-shaped drapery pin through the back of the header and hanging the drapery pin through an eyelet on the rings. These curtains are sold with no hardware like rings or hooks. We try to provide the most accurate digital images possible. Color may appear slightly different from one screen to another based on differences in computer monitors, brightness, and other selected settings so there may be variations in color between the actual product and the way it appears online.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M3vUSEgIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HPD Half Price Drapes","source_asin":"B088MH3X35","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-215346","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088MH3X35","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088MH3X35","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":215347,"name":"Ginkgo International Pendulum 20-Piece Stainless Steel Flatware Place Setting, Service for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VvCTL4mJL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Product Description Ginkgo has been designing quality since 1977. A perfect example of this is our Ginkgo Pendulum 20-Piece Stainless Steel Flatware Set, Service for four.This is an oversized flatware design that is equal parts contemporary and playful. This 20-piece place setting includes four each of the following; salad fork, dinner fork, dinner knife, dinner spoon and teaspoon. Made in Korea of 18/0 Stainless Steel. Dishwasher Safe. Ginkgo. Made for your life. Amazon.com A truly contemporary pattern, Disc shows a playful side for everyday use yet is chic enough for those dressier dinners. Crafted of 18/10 stainless steel in oversized styling, each piece of Disc is completely bead-blasted to a satiny finish except for a circular, mirror-finish insert at the handle end. Spoon bowls curve into inverted egg shapes, the outer fork tines angle inward, and the knife stands out for its sideways handle curl and long triangular blade. In short, this is a pattern that is sure to receive notice from guests. Ready to serve two couples or a family of four, this 20-piece starter set contains four place settings, each of which consists of a 10-inch dinner knife, 8-inch dinner fork, 6-3/4-inch salad fork, 7-3/4-inch soup spoon, and 6-1/2-inch teaspoon. A larger set and accessories are available separately to fully coordinate the table. While Disc is dishwasher-safe and never needs polishing, soaking in water and prolonged exposure to acidic foods should be avoided to prevent spotting. A family-owned business since 1977, Ginkgo International is dedicated to quality design and value when it comes to flatware for the home. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 4 place settings. Each place setting consists of: 10-inch dinner knife; 8-inch dinner fork; 6-3/4-inch salad fork; 7-3/4-inch soup spoon; 6-1/2-inch teaspoon. 20 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VvCTL4mJL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ginkgo","source_asin":"B000BPO58C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-215347","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000BPO58C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000BPO58C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
