window.products.push({"id":215395,"name":"Wood Coat Hooks - White Modern Hat Hanger (Pack of 4) Handmade Vintage Towel Rack, Nursery Backpack Organizer, Baseball Hat Storage","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zjg+ygEVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Natural wood coat hangers - make your place both functional and stylish! Decorative wall wood hooks are perfect organizer for a coat, towel, robe, hat, backpack, jewelry, keys, to hang at home, office, bar or loft. You can use it also as a wooden wall mounted decor at the office entryway — White colors will support business style. You can use it also like a wooden wall decor for your child`s bedroom, playroom, bathroom or entryway - children will like nice colors and you will have a chance to have nursery well organized! Set of 4 pcs is good for display baseball caps or just to add creativity to your storage. Wooden wall hooks are more than just functional - they make your place stylish and natural (no matter what you need - vintage or modern home design). Specifications . Product Technical Details Package ：4pcs / lot Material : Ashwood hooks, metal screw, plastic wall anchor Color : White Surface : Natural Wax Oil process Hook size : Length (short side): 3.1\" (7.8 cm) // diameter: 0.9\" (2.2cm) EASY TO INSTALL : ① Make a 0.3\" (8 mm) hole on the wall② Insert wall anchor into the hole and screw on - stop at about 0.2\" (5 mm) from the wall③ Hang up wooden hook About VIRKE : We believe that home design affects the inner state of a person and the whole family. High-quality home accessories help you feel comfortable at home and inspire you for better living. That is why we pay a lot of attention to design and quality of every product and every detail. Natural materials (mainly wood), pleasing to eye colors, minimalism in design - that is what we offer you. VIRKE products are designed in Scandinavia and manufactured with a great attention to detail. 100% natural wood. If there are any issues, we'll give you a full refund or replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zjg+ygEVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"virke","source_asin":"B07YYM95F2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-215395","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YYM95F2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YYM95F2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":215396,"name":"Portable Air Conditioners - 4-IN-1 Air Conditioner Portable for Room, Evaporative Air Cooler w/ 4 Modes, 3 Speeds, 1.32 Gallon Water Tank, 90°Oscillat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wC+Ls93VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄【4 In 1 Humidifying & Cooling & Fan & Negative Ions】This portable air conditioners introduce innovative cooling technology with quiet high speed spinning fan along with plant fiber curtain to release ice water into the fresh cold and moist wind, cool and humidify the surrounding in the most comfortable and fastest way. No more hot and dry this summer. It can be used as a tower fan without water running. ❄【Sleep Mode & Timer & Remote Control】This portable air conditioner is designed with 4 modes (cool, normal, natural and sleep) and 3 wind speeds (high/medium/low). Sleep soundly throughout the night without waking up in a sweaty mess. Set the 1-7hrs timer function, no worry about being cold at night. And the remote control offers you total peace and enjoyment without getting up from bed. ❄【Ultra-quiet & Energy Saving】Thanks to the ultra-quiet spinning fan engine, the noise of this air conditioner portable for room is lower than 50 dB, which is considered whisper-quiet. With 65W rated power, no installation is needed it reduces your bills by 80%, no damaging refrigerants, no vent is needed, let this portable AC cools you and adds moisture to air-reducing dry air symptoms such as itchy eyes, throat, or skin in dry climates. ❄【Top Refilling & 5L Big Capacity Bottom Water Tank & 4 Ice Packs】Tired of bending over and adding water frequently? Our evaporative air cooler is designed with easy top refilling which is friendly to the elder and disabled people, besides, the bottom 1.32 Gallon big capacity water tank allows this air conditioner portable to run for up to 21 hours. The air cooler comes with extra 4 Ice packs which could deliver continuous cooling repeatably. ❄【90° Oscillation & 360° Universal Wheels】Do you need a portable ac air conditioner that is easy to remove in rooms, well, Laluztop portable air conditioners are a perfect choice. Comes with 4 universal wheels which allow you easily take it to any room, no extra installation is needed. The inner blades are designed with 90° swing automatically to cool down your room evenly, moreover, you can manually adjust the blowing direction vertically at 120° freely. ❄【100% SATISFYING CUSTOMER SERVICE】 We back you up with our 7/24 online customer service, with 60 days money back and 12 months replacement, if there is any problem with portable air conditioners, just feel free to contact us for a solution. Love it or pay nothing. ❤ Warm Note: Please make sure the blades are manually opened before you turn on the fan. ( tear off the protective film on two sides and manually open the blades by pulling one of them up). Make sure the water is refilled till it's above the MIN mark(the water line) at the bottom of the machine. It will start to pump water and go down through the top tank, then it realizes a cooling-off effect when you choose COOL mode. Please notice that: This machine DOESN'T MIST under COOL mode.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wC+Ls93VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laluztop","source_asin":"B0C5H81C82","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-215396","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5H81C82","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5H81C82","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
