window.products.push({"id":215428,"name":"Beistle Speakeasy Plastic Door Cover- 1 pc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XmyNkRGIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It's printed with a wooden door with signs that read “closed keep and enforce Prohibition”, “no beer! National Prohibition act” and “closed for violation of national Prohibition act” with shadows of policemen approaching. It's the perfect inexpensive party decoration for your Speakeasy, great 20's, or gangster theme party! Hang it on your door and it will create an exciting and intriguing entrance to your party. You can also hang it on the wall and it will set the tone of your party and take you back to the 20's.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XmyNkRGIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beistle","source_asin":"B07C9CJCBN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-215428","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C9CJCBN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C9CJCBN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":215429,"name":"Lush Decor Gray and White Farmhouse Recycled Yarn-Dyed Cotton Plaid 5-Piece Comforter Set (King)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":157.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91m5y-KfIEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you thinking of giving your bedroom an upgrade but you're too overwhelmed by all of the decor options? Improving the look of a room does not have to involve a major change. Sometimes all it takes is a change of bedding. A new bedding set can bring style and elegance to your bedroom, and it can provide an attractive focal point for your bedroom—but not all sets are created equal. You need covers that are made with fine fabric and tasteful style. The Lush Decor Gray and White Farmhouse Comforter Set beautifully combines style and comfort. Our bedding comforter set features a neutral-colored plaid print that’s both stylish and elegant. Its classic design never goes out of style, giving your room a cozy, rustic charm that people will instantly notice. Whether your bedroom has a contemporary or vintage theme, our plaid bedding will blend in beautifully.Designed for your king-size bed, this set includes the following: 1 thick checkered blanket that measures 92\" x 104\", 2 pillow shams that measure 20\" x 36\" with a 2-inch flange, and 2 Euro shams that measure 26\" x 26\" with a 2-inch flange. Made with recycled cotton and a polyester fill, our modern farmhouse bedding set is eco-conscious. Luxurious comfort that's earth-friendly doesn't have to be difficult to maintain. Our high-quality rustic comforter set is easy to clean. Just toss it in the washing machine with similarly colored fabrics on a cold, gentle cycle, and you're all set. Because it washes well and features a classic, neutral design, this farm bedding set makes a lovely and thoughtful gift for special occasions. It's the perfect way to bring a smile to someone’s face! When it comes to decorating a bedroom, choose a comforter made of top-grade fabric that's designed to last while reflecting your refined taste. Add the Lush Decor Gray and White Farmhouse Comforter Set to your master or guest bedroom to elevate your interior decor style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91m5y-KfIEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lush Decor","source_asin":"B081XXKS7W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-215429","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081XXKS7W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081XXKS7W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
