window.products.push({"id":215448,"name":"2016 Goebel Angel Bell ( LAVENDER ) 41st Edition - 40th Anniversary","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41wfkkYqRxL._AC_.jpg","description":"Resealing Snack Bags - Perfect Food Storage Tool Are you still worried about overeating? With this sealer, it can reseal various snack bags to keep the snack freshness and flavor. Never worry about your containers leaking or opening which lead a mess or food spoilage. This mini sealer can seal the food bag to keep the food fresh and dry. And open it at any time you want. Just press and pull the mini food cutter across the bag. You can use this bag resealer to sealing pocket snack, packing handmade baking biscuit, Sub-packaged beans for storage. And the sealing of chip bags, fruit bags, nut bags, candy bags, etc. The mini heat sealer has the function of breaking the packaging, so you don't need to find scissors when you tear it! UNIQUE DESIGN Portable and mini design sealer can be put into your pocket. Suitable for kitchen, hunting, fishing, camping, travel, etc.. The unique hook and slot design can not only prevent the resistance wire from heating up all the time, but also hang the hot bag sealing machine on the kitchen or other items. Quick sealing and cutting One end of the sealing machine can seal the bag, the whole process will not exceed 10 seconds, the other end can be cut at the other end, and it can be cut in just 1 second. Easy to use 1. Install AA*2 batteries into the sealer. (batteries not included). 2. Press and slide it slowly across the top of the package with your thumb for 3-5 seconds to heat up. 3. Put the bag to be sealed in the middle and slowly pull it with constant speed. The seal can be repeated multiple times. NOTE: 1.Please replace the battery in time when the battery power is insufficient. 2.Please remove the battery if it is not used for a long time. 3.Unsuitable Bags: pure paper packaging bag and aluminum foil packaging bag. Color: Dark Grey Size: Length 14 cm / 5.5inch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41wfkkYqRxL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cherline","source_asin":"B01C3BISQQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-215448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01C3BISQQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01C3BISQQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
