window.products.push({"id":215597,"name":"COSIEST Sideboard Storage Cabinet, Vintage MDF Accent Cabinet with Adjustable Shelf, Free-Standing Buffet Server Console Cabinet for Kitchen Dining Ro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gYDScJewL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Ingenious Design】 : This entryway serving cabinet is crafted uniquely. It’s small and compatible outside, but has plenty of room inside. It’s featured with inwardly facing hinges, which is easier to grease and avoiding any breakages or unnecessary removal of the screwing system. The design of the rebound self-locking device makes it easy to open and close the door without handles, ensuring complete protection of the stored items. ✅【Quality Material】 : Made of high-quality MDF material, it's sturdy enough to weather any elements, which assures quality and long-lasting service. The floral carvings（Dark brown） on the solid pine doors emphasize the artistic touch. This is a vintage approach to the design, which adds more value to it, as crafting older designs gets more credit in this era. The floor cabinet is also equipped with an anti-tipping strap that can be fixed to the wall for safety. ✅【Enough Storage】 : There is plenty of room inside the buffet cabinet with storage, complementing a detachable internal shelf. This style of shelving gives the accent cabinet flexible storage space, which eliminates any limitations of the stuff, regardless of the shape or sides. You can also include your customized storage compartments to work with, especially if you are working to store small accessories. ✅【Conducive Size】 : The sideboard measures 32 inches L by 15.75 inches W by 36.5 inches H. This makes the piece an excellent choice as its width can fit in narrow pathways and entryways. The spacious countertop can display the vases and decorations you desire to grace your space. As for storage purposes, you can place it in any room to serve your purpose, including storing pieces of art, precious drinks, or your collections. ✅【Durability and Stability】 : This storage sideboard is very stable as it has four thickened sculpted legs with a stronger load-bearing capacity, which can maintain perfect stability even when the floor is slightly uneven. This allows you to store heavy loads - if that’s the intended purpose of the cabinet. It also has protective pads to eliminate sliding, reducing vibration and noise. The smooth edges and surfaces are designed to avoid sharpness and wood burrs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gYDScJewL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSIEST","source_asin":"B0C3M1BHFQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-215597","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3M1BHFQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3M1BHFQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
