window.products.push({"id":215688,"name":"Heroecol 2Pc (56\" Tall) (12\" Board Wide ) Industrial Iron Pipe Shelf Shelves Bookshelf Bookcase Shelving Bracket Vintage Retro Black Open DIY Storage ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YY3IU7zzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Applicable sites: If you only want the shelving unit to attach to the wall ,instead of the ceiling,Then our shelf is your choice；Easy \"do it yourself\" project for your . Each purchase will include all of the parts needed (pipes and fittings) to complete this open pipe shelf system.You can use it “DIY” your's bookshelf、kitchen shelf、bathroom shelf、flowers shelf、and so,add extra space；Products included4x Elbows, 6x Tees , 10x Flange, 10x 12\" Cross deep long pipe, 8x 11 \" Vertical short pipe, Matching Screws ;）Installation note easy to put together, assembled the entire unit; leveled and screwed in the top- then worked way down,leveled then screwed into the wall, all around.  Definitely need better wall anchors though.Part Flange, Elbows, and Three-way Valve are all 3/4 inch diameter pipes;Color matt black classic industrial retro;PipePipe color matt black classic industrial retro;Thread drawing special process, smooth and supple;","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YY3IU7zzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Heroecol","source_asin":"B07JHC6BZN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-215688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JHC6BZN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JHC6BZN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":215689,"name":"LAMEJOR Duvet Cover Set Queen Size Plaid/Grid Pattern Geometric Checkered Hotel Luxury Soft Bedding Set Comforter Cover (1 Duvet Cover+2 Pillowcases) ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HNClbhnTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【WHAT YOU CAN GET】: It does NOT include the comforter. This is duvet COVER, it's a cover for comforter or duvet. You need to put your own duvet inside just like you put a pillow inside the pillowcase. 1 Queen duvet cover(90\"L x 90\"W), 2 pillowcases(30\"L x 20\"W). This Plaid/Grid Duvet Cover offers a luxuriously soft hand feel, and it also provides breathability, wrinkle-resistance, and long-lasting strength. Duvet Cover has a zipper closure and ties to secure the insert. ✔【PLAID/GRID DECORATION DESIGN 】: Add a contemporary touch to the center of your suite with this lovely duvet set. Simple yet sophisticated, this plaid/grid duvet cover set will update your bedroom without overwhelming your ensemble. Our Duvet Cover with this classic, bold plaid pattern can be your addition to your home with any style, modern, classic, mid-century, farmhouse, Industrial, etc. It is a simple but graphic statement pattern. ✔【PREMIUM FABRIC】: Our Duvet Cover Set is woven from the highest quality microfiber material, the feel of the fabric is like percale “cotton” (It is not cotton) and will continue to soften with each wash. Create a serene sleeping experience, leaving you feeling ultimate softness and comfort. Our Duvet Cover Sets are are Fade and Pilling Resistant. They will come out of the dryer looking fresh every time. And yes, they also are Wrinkle Resistant. ✔【EASY USE & CLEANING】: Each Plaid Duvet Cover complete with zipper closure, and it is easy to remove and wash. Also there are ties at each corner of the duvet cover, your comforter will stay in place nicely in the duvet cover. Machine washable in cold water and tumble dry on low. Fade, stain, shrink and wrinkle resistant. ✔【ULTIMATE GIFT IDEA】: If you are looking for something as a Christmas, New Year, Holidays, Birthday's gift to your mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter and all other beloved ones, this duvet cover set is a absolutely gorgeous choise.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HNClbhnTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAMEJOR","source_asin":"B083LWYFCX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-215689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083LWYFCX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083LWYFCX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
