window.products.push({"id":215840,"name":"Mundial Olivier Anquier 6\" Boning Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21BYJT3CJDL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Fully forged from high-carbon stainless steel, the Olivier line combines Mundial performance with a bold, ruggedly handsome, wood-handled design that's unlike anything else on the market today. From the Manufacturer The Mundial Olivier Anquier 6-inch boning knife features a narrow, curved blade that's ideal for removing meat from poultry bones and other hard-to-access meat sections. Fully-forged from high-carbon stainless steel, the Olivier Anquier line combines Mundial performance with a bold, ruggedly-handsome, wood-handled design that's unlike anything else on the market today. The result is a distinctive yet beautiful set of cutlery. Each knife is branded on both the blade and tip of the handle with the Olivier name and logo in burnished steel. The line's unique, one-piece solid wood handles are more than just aesthetically appealing--they're also ergonomically-shaped to fit the hand comfortably, with gripping edges that ensure maximum control and precision for every cutting task. The Value of a Fully-Forged Knife Mundial knives, with very few exceptions, are fully-forged in a manufacturing process that combines innovative technology with old-world tradition and expertise. In the forging process, steel is heated to an extremely high temperature, set into a die, and hammered into the shape of the basic blade. Following a heating and cooling process, the forged blade is ground to create a full taper to the cutting edge. The result is a stronger, thicker, more resilient blade that flares smoothly at the heel to blend into the shape of the handle. Fully-forged cutlery offers an array of key benefits, including greater tensile strength, increased durability, lasting sharpness, and better balance and control. Construction Mundial's computer-aided design creates the perfect shape and balance for chopping, dicing, and slicing all types of food. The knives are fully-forged from high-carbon, chrome molybdenum, stainless steel for the best edge retention and sharpening ease. Each knife also undergoes Mundial's computerized blade grinding and polishing process to create a precise taper from tip to bolster (the main feature of any forged knife). Busy chefs will appreciate the ergonomically-crafted handles with full tangs that deliver comfort, balance, and durability. Every Mundial knife is also hand-sharpened and individually-tested for ultimate performance. Quality Control How do Mundial knives compare to other premium cutlery? In addition to its extensive quality control procedures, Mundial regularly submits its products to an international independent testing facility. These standardized testing methodologies continue to show that Mundial knives are among the best in the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21BYJT3CJDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mundial","source_asin":"B0002LXTJG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-215840","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002LXTJG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002LXTJG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
