window.products.push({"id":215876,"name":"Opoiar 8 Inch Gel Memory Foam Mattresses,Pressure Relieving/CertiPUR-US Certified/Bed-in-a-Box/Breathable Washable Mattress Cover/Made in USA,King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":369.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UU3PhplwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🛏️[Pressure Relieving] The 8-inch double-layer memory foam mattress has a medium firmness to relieve your spine pressure, when you lie on the mattress your spine and the mattress fit perfectly, the top layer of 2\" gel foam to provide you with a cool and soft feeling, the bottom layer of 10\" high-density memory foam to ensure adequate support 🛏️[Super Air Cell Cooling System] The air cell cooling system provides a cool and comfortable sleep experience through two structures: first, the top of the thick pad is a 6\" gel foam; second, the advanced mattress protect incorporates bamboo charcoal fibers and moisture-wicking activated carbon, which provides a cool, dry and comfortable sleep environment 🛏️[Safe and comfortable sleeping environment] The mattress is made of CertiPUR certified foam in the U.S. and is free of harmful emissions and substances such as formaldehyde, mercury and other heavy metals. The cover is made of hypoallergenic cotton, which is very friendly to our skin, and the washable zipper makes it easy to wash in the washing machine on a regular basis 🛏️[Roll Compressed Packaging in Boxes] The mattress is compressed by a professional machine in a hot and clean environment, then rolled and placed in a vacuum airtight bag, and then packed in a box. When you receive this box just need to open the box and airtight bag will mattress ventilation rest 16 hours to completely fluff, no odor, easy to assemble 🛏️ [100% Worry-Free] 🛏️ We offer 104 days free trial sleeping experience, if you are not satisfied with the mattress, you can return it for free","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UU3PhplwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Opoiar","source_asin":"B0C2C47CPG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-215876","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2C47CPG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2C47CPG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
