window.products.push({"id":215907,"name":"Welcome Sign For Front Door- Front Door Decor Front Porch Decorations Hanging Sign Rustic White Wooden Farmhouse signs on Paulownia Wood 12 x 12 Inch ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fZGwbsCSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Want to welcome your guests into your home in style? Whenever you have guests coming over, it is always important to make them feel welcome and comfortable. This way, they will definitely remember you in a positive way. Welcome mats can help but these often just become a rug for wiping dirt off of your shoes. A welcome sign all covered in dirt isn’t just unpleasant, it won’t help enhance the appearance of your front door, too. Make your guests feel welcome as soon as they step in front of your home by mounting a stylish sign on your door. Give your home a welcoming atmosphere and include your fur babies to welcome your guests with the Happy Naya Wooden Dog Welcome Sign! Decorate your home and create a good first impression with this wooden front porch welcome sign. It features the word \"Welcome we hope you like dogs\" standing out in large white script, written over a rustic black wooden background. This wooden sign will look great on the front door of your home or shop. It is fitted with an attractive bow and adorned with greenery, giving the whole piece a relaxing touch of nature and beauty. Measuring 12\" x 12\", this wooden welcome sign will surely be the first thing your guests will notice as soon as they walk up to your home. It makes an endearing and special Christmas gifts or housewarming presents . Need more time to make a decision? Here are more reasons to love this wooden welcome sign: - Sturdy, durable construction - Will blend well to your existing home decor - May also be used for cafes and restaurants - Won't damage the surface of your door - Add value to your home Spread charm and welcoming vibes to all your guests. Add the Happy Naya Welcome Sign to your cart NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fZGwbsCSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Happy Naya","source_asin":"B093J85VWZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-215907","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093J85VWZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093J85VWZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
