window.products.push({"id":215943,"name":"Ginkgo International Linden 12-Piece Stainless Steel Accessory Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sqGx4VndL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product description 079914340342 Features: -18/10 stainless steel. -Dishwasher safe. -Mirror finish. Material: -Stainless Steel Flatware. Handle Material: -Stainless steel. Amazon.com What fun! A set of mini-forks, knives, and spoons for parties: spearing olives and other appetizers from an hors d'oeuvres platter, spreading herbed butter on bread, or stirring a lump of sugar into an after-dinner espresso. The 12 pieces in the set are smaller versions of Ginkgo's Linden pattern, which is about as easy-going and uncomplicated as flatware comes. The traditionally tapered shape, slight point at the tip of the handles, and smooth, unadorned surface looks clean and appealing. The only design difference is that the party forks have three tines, not four. This accessory set includes four of each of the following: a 5-3/4-inch butter knife, 5-1/4-inch cocktail fork, and 5-inch demitasse spoon. Made of 18/10 stainless steel, the Linden party utensils won't tarnish and are conveniently safe for the dishwasher. A four-piece Linden hostess set is also available separately to complete the look of the well-coordinated table. A family-owned business since 1977, Ginkgo International is dedicated to quality design and value when it comes to flatware for the home. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 1 accessory set. The set includes 4 each: 5-3/4-inch butter knife; 5-1/4-inch cocktail fork; 5-inch demitasse spoon. 12 pieces total. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sqGx4VndL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ginkgo","source_asin":"B0007ZQCFA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-215943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0007ZQCFA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0007ZQCFA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
